        {
            "lang": "cs",
            "description": "Bronzov\u00e9 kop\u00ed s tulejkou, st\u0159edem tuleje provrtan\u00e9 dva otvory, na boc\u00edch patrn\u00e9 odl\u00e9vac\u00ed \u0161vy, okraj tulejky ol\u00e1m\u00e1n. List kop\u00ed m\u00e1 v\u00fdrazn\u00e9 st\u0159edov\u00e9 \u017eebro a plastick\u00e9 li\u0161ty (zes\u00edlen\u00ed) pod\u00e9l okraj\u016f. Viditeln\u00e9 stopy opracov\u00e1n\u00ed b\u0159itu. D\u00e9lka 122 mm, \u0161\u00ed\u0159ka 25,5 mm.",
